  <hashTree>
    <TestPlan guiclass="TestPlanGui" testclass="TestPlan" testname="23127443_Spike_AdminImportProducts_20260817" enabled="true">
      <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Spike Test: Admin Import Products (Transactional)
- WORKFLOW: login admin → get categories → bulk import products → verify
- SPIKE PATTERN: 0 users (30s idle) → 100 users (5s ramp-up) → 100 users (60s hold) → 0 users (5s ramp-down)
- Data-driven from CSV spike_import_products.csv
- JSR223 PreProcessor (Groovy) generates dynamic product payload
- Listener: View Results Tree
- FIX: Header Manager local REPLACES global -&gt; re-declare Content-Type
- FIX: Groovy script uses Groovy syntax (not JavaScript)</stringProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.functional_mode">false</boolProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.tearDown_on_shutdown">false</boolProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.serialize_threadgroups">false</boolProp>
